Subject: [PATCH] ios-m0: gate WebView compositor launch/connect

The default M0 build does not launch the Compositor helper. Gate the WebView
launch and WebContent connection calls for iOS; app mode can still reverse
these exact gates before configuring the interactive UIKit build.
--- a/Libraries/LibWebView/Application.cpp
+++ b/Libraries/LibWebView/Application.cpp
@@ -550,0 +551 @@
+#if !defined(AK_OS_IOS)  // iOS M0: no compositor process to connect to
@@ -551,0 +553 @@
+#endif
@@ -866,0 +869 @@
+#if !defined(AK_OS_IOS)  // iOS M0: Compositor deferred (GPU/ANGLE); headless raster needs no present helper
@@ -867,0 +871 @@
+#endif
